'''Nightstar''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Christmas Box]] in the [[Christmas Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has a dark purple color in the handle which blends into a lighter purple color on the top of the blade, it has a constellation on the blade.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Nightsky|gun counterpart]] with a similar name. 
* This knife used to be named "Constellation" upon release, It was later changed to Nightstar.

